⛓️‍💥 HOW MANY MTM COULD YOU RECEIVE? CHECK BEFORE YOU STAKE

You do not need to calculate staking rewards yourself.

Open Staking, choose a plan and enter your MTM amount. Before confirmation, the app displays:

🔹 how many MTM you are staking;
🔹 your calculated reward;
🔹 when the plan ends;
🔹 your expected final amount.

You can start with 250 MTM. Review the calculation and choose the option that works for you.

🔓 If you cancel early, your staked MTM is returned in full, but the reward from the incomplete plan is forfeited.

👉 Check your expected result in METATRONICS → On-Chain Wallet → Staking → Choose a plan
